#. i18n: file: src/konqueror.kcfg:317
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (HistorySettings)
#: rc.cpp:224
msgid "Maximum number of history items per view"
msgstr "Maksymalnô wielëna elementów historëji w wëzdrzatkù"

#. i18n: file: src/konqueror.kcfg:518
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Trash)
#: rc.cpp:294
msgid "Ask confirmation for deleting a file."
msgstr "Pëtôj ò pòcwierdzenié dlô rëmaniô lopka."

#. i18n: file: src/konqueror.kcfg:519
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Trash)
#: rc.cpp:297
msgid ""
"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you "
"delete a file without using the trash folder. Warning, deleted files can not "
"be recovered, so it is recommended to leave this confirmation enabled."
msgstr ""
"Na òptacëjô gôdô Konquerorowi ò tim, czë mô òn sã pëtac ò pòcwierdzenié "
"rëmaniô lopka z pòminiãcem kòsza. Bôczë na to, że tak rëmniãti lopk ni mòże "
"wëdostac nazôd. Zamòdlëwô sã aktiwòwanié pòcwierdzenia."

#. i18n: file: src/konqueror.kcfg:524
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Trash)
#: rc.cpp:300
msgid "Ask confirmation for move to trash"
msgstr "Pëtôj ò pòcwierdzenié dlô przesëniãcô do kòsza."

#. i18n: file: src/konqueror.kcfg:525
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Trash)
#: rc.cpp:303
msgid ""
"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you move "
"the file to your trash folder, from where it can be recovered very easily."
msgstr ""
"Na òptacëjô gôdô Konquerorowi ò tim, czë mô òn sã pëtac ò pòcwierdzenié "
"przesëniãcô lopka do kòsza. Z kòsza mòże letkò wëdostac lopczi nazôd."

#. i18n: file: src/konqueror.kcfg:532
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Trash)
#: rc.cpp:309
msgid ""
"If true, when opening a session from within the sessions dialog the tabs "
"will be opened inside current window."
msgstr ""
"Jeżlë prôwdzëwi, òbczas òtmëkaniô sesëjów z bënë dialogòwégò òkna sesëjów, "
"kôrtë bãdą òtemkniãté bënë biéżnégò òkna."

